    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Game Room \u2014 your virtual gaming room!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of exciting leisure, where various classic and modern games are gathered in one room. Controlling the character in first-person mode, you can freely explore the gaming space, approach arcade machines or tables, and enjoy your favorite activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A Variety of Games:</strong><br>Play checkers, darts, air hockey, billiards, or try classic arcade machines featuring &quot;Snake,&quot; &quot;Arkanoid,&quot; and pinball. There's something for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global Leaderboard:</strong><br>Track your progress on the board that displays total scores across all games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>First-Person Mode:</strong><br>Walk around the room, approach games, interact with objects, and feel the vibrant atmosphere of a live arcade zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Classics in a Modern Format:</strong><br>Rediscover classic games in a new package that combines nostalgia with modern technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple and Intuitive Gameplay:</strong><br>Play with ease, but prepare for real challenges if you aim to break your records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Room is perfect for all game lovers, whether casual players or fans of retro arcades. It's the ideal place to relax, test yourself in different genres, and have a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master every game? Your Game Room is waiting for you!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Game Room \u2014 your virtual gaming room!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of exciting leisure, where various classic and modern games are gathered in one room. Controlling the character in first-person mode, you can freely explore the gaming space, approach arcade machines or tables, and enjoy your favorite activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A Variety of Games:</strong><br>Play checkers, darts, air hockey, billiards, or try classic arcade machines featuring &quot;Snake,&quot; &quot;Arkanoid,&quot; and pinball. There's something for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global Leaderboard:</strong><br>Track your progress on the board that displays total scores across all games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>First-Person Mode:</strong><br>Walk around the room, approach games, interact with objects, and feel the vibrant atmosphere of a live arcade zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Classics in a Modern Format:</strong><br>Rediscover classic games in a new package that combines nostalgia with modern technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple and Intuitive Gameplay:</strong><br>Play with ease, but prepare for real challenges if you aim to break your records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Room is perfect for all game lovers, whether casual players or fans of retro arcades. It's the ideal place to relax, test yourself in different genres, and have a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master every game? Your Game Room is waiting for you!</strong></p>",
